  "description": "Grimes are delighted to present this charming two-bedroom mid-terrace property to the rental market.  Ideally located just a few minutes walk from Ratoath Village, the property offers well-proportioned and versatile accommodation throughout.  The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance porch, kitchen and bright living room.  Upstairs there are two generous double bedrooms both with fitted wardrobes with the master bedroom benefiting from an en-suite along with a main family bathroom.  The property also benefits from a converted attic space.  To the rear the property boasts a private patio with a seomra together with a separate small utility storage room.  Gas central heating.  No smoking and no pets permitted.  Email enquiries only.",
